{"diagnosis": "Fetch makes no progress: max_addr stays 0x00000000 for 2009 cycles leading to tohost FAIL 0xdead. Excerpt assigns both reg_pc and reg_next_pc to current_pc with no stride, so next fetch re-issues address 0x0. Root cause is missing PC increment at lines 1526-1527, which must add compressed-aware stride (compressed_instr ? 2 : 4) since zero-filled mem decodes as compressed.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1526,2 +1526,2 @@
 				reg_pc <= current_pc;
-				reg_next_pc <= current_pc;
+				reg_next_pc <= current_pc + (compressed_instr ? 2 : 4);
", "expected": "tohost PASS (no FAIL 0xdead) with fetch progress max_addr advancing beyond 0x0 over 256-word walk"}

